=begin pod :page-card<Home> :nav-order<70>

=TITLE All-In

=SUBTITLE For the most dedicated Rakoons

This page is resources for the people who live and breathe Raku, and are 
dedicated to making it the best it can possibly be.  

=item L<Raku Foundation|https://raku.foundation/>

=head3 Raku Steering Council (RSC)

The L<Steering Council|https://github.com/Raku-Steering-Council/Papers> is a 
7-person committee with many responsibilities, including maintaining the quality 
and stability of the Raku language, its compilers, and its ecosystem. Also to 
make contributing and learning Raku as accessible, inclusive, and sustainable as 
possible.

The L<Problem Solving|https://github.com/Raku/problem-solving> repository 
contains issues that impact Raku which require consensus to resolve. The RSC is 
responsible for guiding any deadlocked issues to completion.

=end pod
